QUERY NAME: JF FZ2000
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MonthlyOutput.TestCode, MonthlyOutput.Buyer, MonthlyOutput.Month, MonthlyOutput.WorkGroup, MonthlyOutput.Volume, TestorProduct.UnitPriceVLAgen, [Volume]*[UnitPriceVLAgen] AS Total
FROM MonthlyOutput INNER JOIN TestorProduct ON MonthlyOutput.TestCode = TestorProduct.ItemCode
WHERE (((MonthlyOutput.Buyer)="FZ2000"));

